   "prompt": "<p>For the following exercises, consider the gamma function given by $\\Gamma (a)=\\int_0^{\\infty}e^{-y}y^{a-1}dy .$</p><p>Show that $\\Gamma (a)=(a-1)\\Gamma (a-1).$</p>",
   "answer": {
